---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Hello, Everyone! Welcome to my portfolio.</h1>
			<p>
				I am John Lazaro a Computer Systems Technology graduate with a strong interest in becoming
				a versatile worker in many fields in the world.
			</p>
			<p>
				I started off my education with a strong passion for becoming a electronic systems engineer
				however, I struggled to complete my diploma. Throughout my time as a engineering student
				I've been learning how to code as I chose a software heavy capstone project that made me develop
				an interest in software development.
			</p>
			<p>
				That is where I swapped to Computer Systems Technology with the intent of only learning programming
				but, I was in for a surprise that would greatly benefit my career. I learned about infrastructure
				management and security, along with the work process of developing a full stack application with
				a team. I found the classes to be very interesting however, I had to go through many obstacles
				outside of my education juggling parenthood and my academics.
			</p>
			<p>
				It was a tough path to my diploma however, I had a lot of dedication to become a programmer. That dedication
				helped me push through my struggles and push for the diploma and graduate my program. As a graduate right now,
				I am working multiple part time jobs under many different fields to build my transferable skills and knowledge
				on how I can assist the workers under them with my skillset.
			</p>
			<p>
				"I am no longer a jack of all trades. You can now call me the king of all trades!"
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
